She was a recipient of the NSF CAREER Award in 2007. She regularly
serves as a Technical Program Committee (TPC) Member for leading IEEE
conferences, including IEEE INFOCOM, IEEE ICC, IEEE GLOBECOM, and
IEEE WCNC. She serves as an Associate Editor for IEEE T RANSACTIONS
